  "id": "RMREMIND0000001",
  "name": "[RMMKT] RM \u00b7 5 Decision-day reminder",
  "description": null,
  "active": true,
  "isArchived": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## RM \u00b7 5 \u2014 the nudge\n\n**Starts:** Mon/Wed/Fri 08:05, or *Run on demand*.\n\nCards are only sent on decision days, so anything produced in between is held. This flushes the held\nones and re-sends whatever is still undecided, with its age.\n\nWithout it an item that missed its slot would sit in the draft forever and silently never publish.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "overview-note",
      "name": "What this workflow does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cron",
      "name": "Mon/Wed/Fri 08:05",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "5 8 * * 1,3,5"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "manual",
      "name": "Run on demand",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "flush",
      "name": "Gateway: flush held cards",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:8787/telegram/flush",
        "method": "POST",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-Gateway-Token",
              "value": "={{ $env.RM_GATEWAY_TOKEN }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "id": "remind",
      "name": "Gateway: remind about pending",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:8787/telegram/remind",
        "method": "POST",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-Gateway-Token",
              "value": "={{ $env.RM_GATEWAY_TOKEN }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    }
  ],
